00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:18.390
who are running
Kubernetes on-prem,

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:21.760
whether it's through
support from Redhat or SUSE.

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:24.570
But it was interesting to hear
