00:35:05.830 --> 00:35:07.534
I'm going to bring
in the serve model.

00:35:07.534 --> 00:35:08.950
So I'm going to
do the same thing.

00:35:08.950 --> 00:35:11.770
So here I have the
Python-based serve model.

00:35:11.770 --> 00:35:14.850
I'm just going to save
it as a different name,

00:35:14.850 --> 00:35:19.350
and then literally drop that
operator, add a R operator,

00:35:19.350 --> 00:35:25.800
and then use that for
serving this graph,

00:35:25.800 --> 00:35:27.859
so that you can see the
prediction difference.

00:35:27.859 --> 00:35:30.150
And this is something that
data scientists would always

00:35:30.150 --> 00:35:33.840
