always something new coming in

00:35:33.840 --> 00:35:36.720
from the different
libraries, so you

00:35:36.720 --> 00:35:40.200
want to ensure that you can
get as close a prediction

00:35:40.200 --> 00:35:40.860
to real time.

00:35:46.052 --> 00:35:46.730
All right.

00:35:46.730 --> 00:35:49.350
So I'm just going to drop that.

00:35:53.290 --> 00:35:56.540
I'm bringing in
the R serve model.

00:36:00.790 --> 00:36:03.010
And then I'm going to
connect to the model

00:36:03.010 --> 00:36:06.100
that I created using my R train.

00:36:16.243 --> 00:36:19.490
Do the same prediction now.

00:36:19.490 --> 00:36:23.930
So I switch from 50
days to 500 days,

00:36:23.930 --> 00:36:26.050
and you see, in
