only three of them were used,

00:42:30.950 --> 00:42:32.780
they pushed a campaign.

00:42:32.780 --> 00:42:35.900
And out of that came
in use of four more.

00:42:35.900 --> 00:42:39.380
But then persistently, they saw
that in all different regions,

00:42:39.380 --> 00:42:40.880
three were not being
used, then they

00:42:40.880 --> 00:42:43.580
stopped the production of those,
because it was not being used.

00:42:43.580 --> 00:42:48.080
At the same time, they also
were matching that data

00:42:48.080 --> 00:42:50.660
with the enterprise data in SAP.

00:42:50.660 --> 00:42:54.020
All these kind of raw streaming
data came in together.

00:42:54.020 --> 00:42:56.580
If you or me are paying
thousands of dollars for this,

00:42:56.580 --> 00:42:59.030
we want to see that
it is not lying around

00:42:59.030 --> 00:43:02.090
for three to four months,
when the service vendor comes

00:43:02.090 --> 00:43:03.380
and gives us service, right?

00:43:03.380 --> 00:43:05.820
So we were able
to bring the data,

00:43:05.820 --> 00:43:08.510
mash it up with the
customer information,

00:43:08.510 --> 00:43:09.750
with the vendor information.

00:43:09.750 --> 00:43:11.690
Then, based on the
error code, they

00:43:11.690 --> 00:43:13.790
were able to
proactively reach out

00:43:13.790 --> 00:43:15.560
to the service
vendor in that area

00:43:15.560 --> 00:43:19.040
and say that please
carry part ABC.

00:43:19.040 --> 00:43:23.330
And more than 85% of the
times, in one single visit,

00:43:23.330 --> 00:43:26.060
they were able to
resolve the issues

00:43:26.060 --> 00:43:29.180
and had a very loyal customer.

00:43:29.180 --> 00:43:33.035
Another quick example is
about how the fitness tracker

00:43:33.035 --> 00:43:33.760
data is there.

00:43:33.760 --> 00:43:36.440
Most of us are using
wearable devices.

00:43:36.440 --> 00:43:41.020
And we were able to now
stream data from there

00:43:41.020 --> 00:43:42.400
across the globe.

00:43:42.400 --> 00:43:45.040
We were able to bring
in the sales figures.

00:43:45.040 --> 00:43:50.300
We were able to bring in
what type of, for example,

00:43:50.300 --> 00:43:54.460
jogging shoe or running shoe
was used by that consumer.

00:43:54.460 --> 00:43:58.060
And not only that, but
when we refined all these,

00:43:58.060 --> 00:44:00.160
we were able to help
them deliver insights.

00:44:00.160 --> 00:44:04.210
We were able to then bring
this data towards an analytics

00:44:04.210 --> 00:44:07.630
dashboard, and bring
out, with the model

00:44:07.630 --> 00:44:10.420
that, based on the
pattern, or the jogging

00:44:10.420 --> 00:44:15.730
pattern of the consumer, and
the type of shoe they have,

00:44:15.730 --> 00:44:21.010
they were able to bring out
much more sale opportunities,

00:44:21.010 --> 00:44:23.300
more than 20% in some regions.

00:44:23.300 --> 00:44:26.540
So that way, they were able to
increase their sales as well.

00:44:26.540 --> 00:44:30.460
And then, very
briefly, you heard also

00:44:30.460 --> 00:44:34.120
from our board member,
[INAUDIBLE] in the morning.

00:44:34.120 --> 00:44:39.100
Here is how SAP is trying
to bring out more--

00:44:39.100 --> 00:44:42.010
how simplified data management
can be in the future.

00:44:42.010 --> 00:44:45.520
Together with SAP HANA, that is
what is our SAP data management

00:44:45.520 --> 00:44:46.570
suite.

00:44:46.570 --> 00:44:50.860
Data Hub is one of the
significant components in that.

00:44:50.860 --> 00:44:52.360
And as you have
seen already, we are

00:44:52.360 --> 00:44:56.050
able to scale out into our
partners, like Google Cloud

00:44:56.050 --> 00:44:59.550
and also others.

00:44:59.550 --> 00:45:01.390
What we are also
trying to deliver now,

00:45:01.390 --> 00:45:04.600
in terms of our
strategy, is gear up all

00:45:04.600 --> 00:45:07.330
of you towards an
intelligent enterprise.

00:45:07.330 --> 00:45:10.910
And there, in the digital
platform, of course,

00:45:10.910 --> 00:45:14.260
is driven through SAP
HANA, and the SAP Data Hub

00:45:14.260 --> 00:45:17.380
