the data management,

00:45:17.380 --> 00:45:20.950
where we are wanting
to help you in all

00:45:20.950 --> 00:45:23.110
the multi-cloud
environments, and have

00:45:23.110 --> 00:45:25.810
that seamless flow
of data, manage

00:45:25.810 --> 00:45:30.410
and give you a wonderful
customer experience as well.

00:45:30.410 --> 00:45:35.660
And just a brief
takeaway, if you will,

00:45:35.660 --> 00:45:37.880
how SAP Data Hub is
then going to help

00:45:37.880 --> 00:45:41.630
you bring in a kind
of consolidated view

00:45:41.630 --> 00:45:47.300
