data quality and cleansing.

00:45:57.020 --> 00:46:00.560
We will be able to help
you with kind of enrichment

00:46:00.560 --> 00:46:04.850
of the data, how we can
have distributed processing

00:46:04.850 --> 00:46:08.240
across these kind of
hyperscale architectures,

00:46:08.240 --> 00:46:12.680
